msgid "vision.quote.1"
msgstr "A wind that never rests sweeps along those who let themselves be swept away."

msgid "vision.quote.2"
msgstr "A cold, filthy rain falls endlessly upon those who were never satisfied."

msgid "vision.quote.3"
msgstr "Forever pushing boulders are those who wanted to keep everything."

msgid "vision.quote.4"
msgstr "In the marsh the wrathful bite each other; beneath the mud sigh those who did nothing."

msgid "vision.quote.5"
msgstr "Open tombs burn for those who denied the soul."

msgid "vision.quote.6"
msgstr "A river of blood boils for those who shed it."

msgid "vision.quote.7"
msgstr "Ten ditches hold those who lied with a smile."

msgid "vision.quote.8"
msgstr "The ice does not forgive whoever betrayed trust."

msgid "vision.quote.9"
msgstr "Beyond the ice awaits the throne of the first to fall."

msgid "vision.quote.10"
msgstr "Nothing remains. Only you and the darkness that follows."

